      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Reckless\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/48/2467_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Reckless:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Mayday brand 63.5 X 88 sleeves.&nbsp; Premium would be worth it, as many cards stick up out of the sleeves, otherwise.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>That actually depends on which printing of the EE you have. &nbsp;I've been told that newer versions of the EE have/will have the cards cut to the correct height.</p>",
