      "created_at": "2012-12-30T21:52:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I've been using Fantasy Flight's 63.5 by 88 mm sleeves. At least, that's how they are labeled. Just measured one and it's actually 67 x 94 mm.</p><p>The sleeved cards don't come anywhere close to fitting in the EE box.</p><p>They feel really nice, though.</p>",
