      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/awmiller/{size}/2243_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-31T00:09:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I use exclusively KMC Perfect Size sleeves for everything, and the entirety of Sentinels fits in the EE box with all of the promos and additional swag from the Kickstarters. The box doesn't quite close because I have all 3 rulebooks (EE, RC, and IE) and the oversized villain cards on top of everything. That being said, it all fits.</p>",
