      "id": 50843,
      "name": "Katsue",
      "username": "Katsue",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/{size}/2012_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-31T08:56:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The cheap Ultra-Pro sleeves kind of fit in the box (they all went in, but they bowed out the side), and then as someone suggested I cut out the side inner lining of the box, and now they do fit perfectly in the box. That's with all the expansions and promo cards, and Unity and Ambuscade. Put them in with the top of the cards facing the inside divider and they might all fit without having to cut up the box. The tops will be squeezed, but it's not a big deal.</p>",
      "post_number": 11,
      "post_type": 1,
